{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.02]Let me talk to y'all for a second, though\n[00:01.22]Let me get some lights\n[00:01.94]Let me see all the beautiful faces out here\n[00:03.54]Oh\n[00:03.62]Oh, oh, oh (Oh)\n[00:22.36]Took it up another level in this bitch\n[00:30.94]Huh\n[Chorus]\n[00:32.44]I want to hold you, control you\n[00:33.30]I've never seen a soul like yours before, but girl, I adore you\n[00:36.06]Would die for you\n[00:37.36]Your ex old news\n[00:39.04]Fuck with me, I'll show you\n[Verse 1]\n[00:47.28]She my queen, used to have a dark king\n[00:50.04]Devil kissed her first, way before me\n[00:52.78]Devil does his worst, he can't harm me\n[00:55.32]He sittin' there alone, I'm like, \"You and what army?\"\n[00:58.22]Baby, I can't help the way I feel\n[01:00.32]Got me havin' love dreams, but this shit is real, real, real\n[01:03.04]Got me poppin' full Percs, don't know how to deal\n[01:05.54]Got me goin' on and on, can't keep still\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[01:10.10]Oh-oh, you belong with me\n[01:15.68]Or no one at all\n[Chorus]\n[01:20.92]I want to hold you, control you\n[01:26.78]I've never seen a soul like yours before, but girl, I adore you\n[01:32.62]Would die for you\n[01:35.68]Your ex old news\n[01:38.14]Fuck with me, I'll show you\n[Verse 2]\n[01:42.00]Lovesick, but I could never get sick of your love\n[01:44.46]When I don't have your love, I'm reachin' for the drugs\n[01:47.24]Like, \"Juice WRLD was so damn high when he pulled up\"\n[01:49.68]It's 'cause I was in Europe and you were back home\n[01:53.44]Yeah, I know we'll last long\n[01:55.86]You killed all the sad love songs\n[01:58.48]I ain't nothin' but a bag of bones\n[02:00.92]But you say that's the most expensive bag you own\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[02:04.30]Oh-oh, you belong with me\n[02:10.86]Or no one at all\n[Chorus]\n[02:11.56]I want to hold you, control you\n[02:21.28]I've never seen a soul like yours before, but girl, I adore you\n[02:27.16]Would die for you\n[02:31.96]Your ex old news\n[02:41.20]Fuck with me,